# Expense Manager API

Standalone ASP.NET Core 8 repository. Clean Architecture with PostgreSQL.

## Related Project

Consumed by a **separate** Next.js frontend repository (`expense-manager-web`).
This repo does not contain frontend code — only maintain API contracts here.

## API Contract

- Base route: `api/v1/[controller]` (singular: `/api/v1/expense`, `/api/v1/category`)
- Auth: JWT Bearer; `UserId` from claims, never request body
- CORS allows `http://localhost:3000` via `Cors:AllowedOrigins` in config
- Document changes in `API_DOC.md` when endpoints or DTOs change

## Before Making Changes

1. Read `AGENTS.md` and relevant docs (`ARCHITECTURE.md`, `SECURITY.md`)
2. Respect Clean Architecture layer boundaries
3. Never commit secrets (`appsettings.Development.json`)
